WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.481 --> 00:00:05.039
(intense music)

00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:12.577
(clock ticking)

00:00:17.344 --> 00:00:20.261
- [Voiceover] Into the
final seconds of the game.

00:00:20.261 --> 00:00:22.586
Buffalo has the ball.

00:00:22.586 --> 00:00:23.640
Fumble!
(crowd roars)

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.774
It's a fumble, I can't believe it!

00:00:25.774 --> 00:00:29.268
(driving music)

00:00:29.268 --> 00:00:30.519
(crowd cheering)

00:00:30.519 --> 00:00:33.472
Herman Edwards runs it down the field.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.991
- [Voiceover] Manning
and the pressure from the

00:00:35.991 --> 00:00:38.456
Patriots' defense, but gets out!

00:00:39.384 --> 00:00:41.193
He throws it way down the field!

00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:41.896
(audience cheering)

00:00:41.896 --> 00:00:42.926
What a catch!

00:00:42.926 --> 00:00:45.353
David Tyree makes the catch!

00:00:45.353 --> 00:00:48.107
- [Voiceover] This is the
Steelers final chance.

00:00:48.107 --> 00:00:49.642
Bradshaw makes the throw.

00:00:49.642 --> 00:00:51.319
It's incomplete.

00:00:51.319 --> 00:00:52.061
No, wait,

00:00:52.061 --> 00:00:53.553
Franco Harris has the ball!
(audience roars)

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:54.906
Touchdown, Steelers!

00:00:54.906 --> 00:00:56.627
- [Voiceover] Montana moves right.

00:00:57.495 --> 00:00:59.483
He throws.

00:00:59.483 --> 00:01:01.170
(spectators cheering)

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.873
Clark catches it, touchdown!

00:01:03.873 --> 00:01:05.617
The crowd is going crazy!

00:01:05.617 --> 00:01:08.810
(music intensifies)

00:01:10.381 --> 00:01:14.899
(brutish grunting)

